## Local development. Run with `overmind start` (see the root CLAUDE.md).
##
## `wrangler dev` is deliberately absent: it serves web/build/, not web/source/, so running it
## alongside Middleman would sit a silently-stale second URL next to the live one. It stays its
## own loop — `rake build:fast` then `npx wrangler dev` — for Worker code and OG cards.
## ⚠️ PORT is pinned because overmind injects a Heroku-style one per process (5000, then +100
## each), and api/config/puma.rb reads ENV["PORT"] — so without this the api silently comes up on
## 5100 and every widget 502s against the KONA_API_URL below.
## `js` builds the api's admin bundle. It runs esbuild through api/esbuild.config.mjs, whose
## context.watch() holds the event loop open by itself — web/'s external pipeline still needs
## esbuild's `--watch=forever` flag, because plain `--watch` exits when stdin closes and overmind
## spawns processes without one.
web:    cd web && bundle exec middleman
api:    cd api && PORT=3000 bin/dev
js:     cd api && npm run watch
worker: cd api && bundle exec sidekiq -C config/sidekiq.yml
